Third-party components
======================

This repository does not re-license any third-party component. Each component is used under its
own license; the license identifiers below were read from the package metadata (uv.lock versions,
2026-10-21) or from the component's official repository / model card.

1. Distributed with this repository
-----------------------------------
None. The repository contains only its own source code, configuration templates and documentation.
No model weights, images, data sets or vendored packages are committed.

